<PARA INFOID = "T120027K061" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "12Apr2004"     INFOTYPE = "SYSTEM" INDSW = "ON">
<TITLE>Illuminated Entry System</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>Illuminated entry control, which keeps the engine switch illumination and the lights on for approximately 15 seconds even after the doors are closed when the front personal light switch and room light switch are in the "DOOR" position, has been adopted as standard on all models.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>If the driver door and front passenger door are locked during illuminated entry control, the lights that are on go off (fade out).</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Door lock light control, which turns on the engine switch illumination, front personal light and room light for approximately 15 seconds when the driver door or front passenger door is unlocked by key-linked operation or the transmitter, when the driver door or front passenger door is unlocked by the smart door lock system, or when the electronic key is recognized within the electronic key detection area of the driver door or front passenger door, has been adopted as standard on all models.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A battery saver function has been adopted that automatically turns off the lights if they remain on for approximately 20 minutes or more with any door ajar or open.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The circuits that control the illuminated entry system and interior illumination are built into the main body ECU (instrument panel junction block assembly).</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>For the illuminated entry and interior illumination, a customize function has been adopted that allows the lighting time of each light by illuminated entry to be changed (approximately 7.5 seconds, approximately 15 seconds, approximately 30 seconds) and interior illumination lighting to be prohibited, by connecting the diagnostic tool (TaSCAN) to DLC3 and operating it. For details of the customize function, refer to Control System. <XREF     REFID = "T285150004T072T096"/>
</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740080e" WIDTH = "6.917in" HEIGHT = "4.542in" />
</FIGURE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>The illuminated entry system is controlled by the main body ECU (instrument panel junction block assembly), to which each light is connected, based on input of the status of each switch, etc.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740107e" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "4.819in" />
</FIGURE>

<MECA ID = "T120027K061K635" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "12Apr2004"     MECATYPE = "GENERAL" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Illuminated Entry Control Function</TITLE>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740037e" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "3.819in" />
</FIGURE>
<INDICATE ID = "T120027K061K635I01" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Illuminated Entry Control Function List</TITLE>
<TABLE FRAME = "ALL" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1">
<TGROUP COLS = "3" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1" TGROUPSTYLE = "Table_10">
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "1" COLNAME = "1" COLWIDTH = "5%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "2" COLNAME = "2" COLWIDTH = "62%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "3" COLNAME = "3" COLWIDTH = "31%"/>
<THEAD>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>No.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Vehicle Condition</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Condition of Each Light<HINTREF REFID = "H285120027K061K63501"/></PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</THEAD>
<TBODY>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>1</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When any door is unlocked with the power source mode (IG) OFF and all doors closed and locked.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminates for 15 seconds (including fade-in), then turns off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>2</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When any door is closed from the open state with the power source mode (IG) ON.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>3</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When the power source mode is changed from (IG) ON to (IG) OFF with all doors closed.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminates for 15 seconds (including fade-in), then turns off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>4</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When any door is closed from the open state with the power source mode (IG) OFF.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminates for 15 seconds (including fade-in), then turns off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>5</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When the electronic key is recognized outside the vehicle with the power source mode (IG) OFF and all doors closed and locked.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminates for 15 seconds (including fade-in), then turns off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>6</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When the power source mode is changed to (IG) ON while the lamps are illuminated by the timer with the power source mode (IG) OFF.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>7</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When all doors are closed and locked while the lamps are illuminated by the timer with the power source mode (IG) OFF.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "0">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>8</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>When any door is opened while the lamps are off.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>On (fade-in)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</TBODY>
</TGROUP>
<LEGEND><HINT>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT ID = "H285120027K061K63501">The lights refer to the front personal light, room light and engine switch illumination.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></HINT></LEGEND></TABLE></INDICATE></MECA>

<MECA ID = "T120027K061Ab06" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "9Jun2006"     MECATYPE = "GENERAL" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Roof Illumination</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>A large roof illumination integrating the front personal light, room light and 3-LED (indirect lighting) illumination light has been provided on the G grade.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740015e" WIDTH = "7.111in" HEIGHT = "3.583in" />
</FIGURE>
<INDICATE ID = "T120027K061Ab06I01" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Roof Illumination Control Function List</TITLE>
<TABLE FRAME = "ALL" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1">
<TGROUP COLS = "3" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1" TGROUPSTYLE = "Table_10">
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "1" COLNAME = "1" COLWIDTH = "7%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "2" COLNAME = "2" COLWIDTH = "60%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "3" COLNAME = "3" COLWIDTH = "32%"/>
<THEAD>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>No.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>Vehicle Condition</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Light<HINTREF REFID = "H285120027K061Ab0601"/> Condition</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</THEAD>
<TBODY>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>1</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When any seat is unlocked from the state with the power source position (IG) OFF, all doors closed and all doors locked.<SUP></SUP></PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Illuminates for approximately 15 seconds (including fade-in) and then goes off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>2</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When any door is opened from the state in No.1 above.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>On (fade-in)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>3</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When all doors are closed from the state in No.2 above.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Illuminates for approximately 15 seconds and then goes off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>4</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When the power source position (IG) is turned ON with the shift position in "P".</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Illuminates dimmed at medium brightness (fade-in)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>5</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When the shift position is moved from "P" to other than "P" with the taillights off, from the state in No.4 above.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>6</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When the shift position is moved from "P" to other than "P" with the taillights on, from the state in No.4 above.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Illuminates dimmed at low brightness</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>7</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When the shift position is moved from other than "P" to "P", from the state in No.5,6 above.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Illuminates dimmed at medium brightness</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>8</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When the power source position (IG) is changed from ON to OFF, from the state in No.7 above.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>On (fade-in)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "0">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>9</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>When all doors are closed and all doors are locked with the power source position (IG) OFF.</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3"><PTXT>Off (fade-out)</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</TBODY>
</TGROUP>
<LEGEND><HINT>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT ID = "H285120027K061Ab0601">The light refers to the indirect lighting.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></HINT></LEGEND></TABLE></INDICATE></MECA>

